  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 27810721792
    m_Localized: They seem to have taken control over the city of love
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1780966879232
    m_Localized: Miaouuuu, Miaouuu ? ... Miaouuuuu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12847969333248
    m_Localized: It looks like someone had fun putting these books in incongruous
      places.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17498424864768
    m_Localized: El bandito wants hair too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67415679823872
    m_Localized: Roger has nothing to feed his favorite friends!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72787018772480
    m_Localized: Natalie went to see the latest El Bandito before going to take a
      coffee outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75465325146112
    m_Localized: It looks like Nicolas is waiting for someone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75820029046784
    m_Localized: It looks like Capucine is waiting for someone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78566513831936
    m_Localized: We wouldn't want anyone to fall, otherwise they'll say it's my fault
      again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 81330073628672
    m_Localized: Ah... damned pigeons! How will Bernard call his client now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83408326094848
    m_Localized: Damien so regrets not going back up to get something to revive himself
      before going for a run
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 323251887009792
    m_Localized: Main Volume
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 323293049909248
    m_Localized: Music Volume
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 323295415496704
    m_Localized: Sound effects Volume
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 725305868546048
    m_Localized: Languages
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 737482113413120
    m_Localized: '<b>Congratulations, you found everything! </b>



      Feel free
      to leave your feedback in the comments. I''m thinking of making more levels
      featuring iconic Parisian locations. Your input is important to me so I know
      what to improve/change, or even if it''s worth continuing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 737630856015872
    m_Localized: Feel free to leave your feedback in the comments. I'm thinking of
      making more levels featuring iconic Parisian locations. Your input is important
      to me so I know what to improve/change, or even if it's worth continuing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 738236953915392
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2478867581628416
    m_Localized: Color Theme
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
